---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer — MyToolMint" description="Important limitations of MyToolMint tools, word data and supporting information.">
  <LegalPage eyebrow="Important information" title="Disclaimer" intro="MyToolMint aims to be accurate and useful, but every tool has limits you should understand.">
    <section><h2>General information</h2><p>MyToolMint provides general-purpose utility output and educational information. It does not provide legal, financial, medical, tax or other professional advice. Check important decisions with an appropriate qualified professional or authoritative source.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Word results</h2><p>English changes, and dictionaries disagree. A word appearing in MyToolMint's results does not guarantee that a school, publisher, tournament or particular word game will accept it. A missing word is not necessarily invalid elsewhere.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Scores and affiliation</h2><p>Tile scores are a generic comparison based on familiar English letter values. MyToolMint is independent and is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by any word-game publisher, trademark owner or competition organiser. Product and game names belong to their respective owners.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Accuracy and availability</h2><p>Reasonable care is taken when building tools and datasets, but results may contain errors and the website may be interrupted or changed. Use the contact page to report a suspected problem.</p></section>
    <section><h2>External links</h2><p>Links to third-party websites are provided for context or support. MyToolMint does not control their content, availability or privacy practices.</p></section>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
